<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>I cannot gaze enough on Thee,</l><l>Thou Fairest of the Fair;</l><l>My heart is filled with ecstasy,</l><l>As in Thy face of radiancy</l><l>I see such beauty there.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>I cannot sing enough of Thee,</l><l>The sweetest name on earth;</l><l>A note so full of melody</l><l>Comes from my heart so joyously,</l><l>And fills my soul with mirth.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>I cannot speak enough of Thee,</l><l>I have so much to tell;</l><l>Thy heart it beats so tenderly</l><l>As Thou dost draw me close to Thee,</l><l>And whisper, “All is well.”</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
